  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e2effc6c8484a4541877dbfe23a82f8a, type: 3}
  m_Name: Story3_NPC1_Mono
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - name: Stranger
    sentences:
    - "I didn\u2019t know her. I want to be clear about that. I came because I didn\u2019t
      want her to disappear into headlines. "
    - "I learned her name the same way I learned the others\u2019. From a list. That
      didn\u2019t feel right."
    - There were a lot of people at the vigil. Someone brought fabric, tied it where
      people could see it move in the wind. Someone else lit something and stayed
      until it burned down. No one told them to. It just felt wrong to leave things
      bare.
    - "I want to stand by her regardless. To remember one person, properly, even
      if I\u2019m late. There are a lot of us like that. Standing quietly. Trying
      not to take up too much space. I hope that\u2019s okay."
